DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssddmmmmcc subsystem provides machine-independent bus support and drivers
     for SD/MMC devices.

     Standard SD/SDHC memory devices will show up as a fake SCSI disk, using
     scsibus(4) and sd(4).

